---
// Tricolor concurrent mark-and-sweep phases + GOGC=100 vs GOMEMLIMIT soft-limit thrashing trap.
const W = 900;
const H = 286;
---
<figure class="ge5d">
  <div class="ge5d-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Go tricolor concurrent mark-and-sweep phases on the left and GOGC=100 doubling trigger versus GOMEMLIMIT soft cap thrashing hazard on the right.">
      {/* Left: Tricolor phases */}
      <rect x="14" y="16" width="446" height="254" rx="10" class="ge5d-card" />
      <text x="30" y="44" class="ge5d-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Concurrent Tricolor Mark &amp; Lazy Sweep</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Quy trình Đánh dấu 3 màu &amp; Dọn lười</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="64" width="414" height="44" rx="6" class="ge5d-box is-red" />
      <text x="44" y="83" class="ge5d-b-red">Phase A: Mark Setup (STW ~10–30 µs)</text>
      <text x="44" y="99" class="ge5d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Briefly pauses goroutines to turn on write barrier</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tạm dừng goroutine vài chục micro giây để bật write barrier</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="118" width="414" height="58" rx="6" class="ge5d-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="137" class="ge5d-b-ok">Phase B: Concurrent Marking (~25% CPU)</text>
      <text x="44" y="154" class="ge5d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Walks live pointers (Black = scanned, Grey = queued, White = free)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lần con trỏ còn sống (Đen = xong, Xám = chờ quét, Trắng = rác)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="186" width="414" height="68" rx="6" class="ge5d-box" />
      <text x="44" y="206" class="ge5d-b">Phase C: Mark Termination (STW) + Lazy Sweep</text>
      <text x="44" y="224" class="ge5d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>White spans stay unfreed until the next goroutine allocates—</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ô Trắng chưa trả ngay; mỗi goroutine đi xin RAM mới</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="240" class="ge5d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>high alloc rates evict L1/L2 CPU caches and tax allocation speed.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>phải tự dọn bù một ít và làm xáo trộn hết CPU cache L1/L2.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right: GOGC vs GOMEMLIMIT */}
      <rect x="478" y="16" width="408" height="254" rx="10" class="ge5d-card" />
      <text x="494" y="44" class="ge5d-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. GC Pacing: GOGC vs. GOMEMLIMIT</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Nhịp chạy GC: GOGC và trần GOMEMLIMIT</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="494" y="64" width="376" height="72" rx="6" class="ge5d-box" />
      <text x="508" y="84" class="ge5d-b">GOGC = 100 (default doubling rule)</text>
      <text x="508" y="102" class="ge5d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Live heap = 100 MiB → next GC runs near 200 MiB</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Heap sống = 100 MiB → chu kỳ GC tới kích hoạt ở ~200 MiB</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="508" y="120" class="ge5d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Higher GOGC trades spare RAM for fewer CPU GC cycles</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tăng GOGC giúp bớt tốn CPU cho GC nếu máy còn dư RAM</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="494" y="148" width="376" height="106" rx="6" class="ge5d-box is-red" />
      <text x="508" y="168" class="ge5d-b-red">GOMEMLIMIT (soft cap — Go 1.19+)</text>
      <text x="508" y="186" class="ge5d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Triggers aggressive GC before container OOM kills.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Ép GC chạy dày hơn khi sắp đụng trần RAM container.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="508" y="204" class="ge5d-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Trap: it is SOFT—not a hard OutOfMemory blocker!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bẫy: đây chỉ là trần MỀM — không chặn hẳn được OOM!</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="508" y="222" class="ge5d-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>If live heap stays over limit, GC thrashes CPU continuously.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Live heap vượt trần là GC quay liên tục ăn hết CPU.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Go schedules garbage collection based on heap growth (GOGC) and soft RAM boundaries (GOMEMLIMIT), not fixed wall timers. Because marking walks every live pointer and sweeping steals allocation time, allocating less beats tuning GC flags alone.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>GC của Go chạy theo nhịp tăng heap (GOGC) và giới hạn mềm GOMEMLIMIT chứ không chạy theo đồng hồ. Cách nhẹ nhất để giảm gánh nặng cho GC vẫn là cấp phát ít rác hơn ngay từ code.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ge5d { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ge5d-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ge5d svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ge5d text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ge5d-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .ge5d-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ge5d-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .ge5d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge5d-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge5d-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge5d-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ge5d-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ge5d-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .ge5d-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .ge5d-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .ge5d figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
